 },
 {
  "id": "1.4._127_",
  "field": "eng",
  "new": "One should avoid (verb in next verse) over-satiety (तृप्ति), curd (दधि), sun exposure (आतप), alkalis (क्षार), animal fat (वसा), oil (तैल), and the eastern wind (पुरः अनिल)",
